      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → fal → fal Settings**.\n2. Describe the person in **Person**.\n3. In **Line**, write what they say.\n4. Press **Run**. The voice and the talking video are saved under `audio/fal` and `video/fal`."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
