      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Two **File: Add** nodes give FlashTalk the face as `image_url` and the voice as `audio_url`. FlashTalk moves the person's lips and face to match the voice. The video is as long as the voice clip.\n\nIf you cancel while the request still waits in fal's queue, fal drops it and bills nothing. A request fal has already started may still finish and be billed. Collect it with **video-05-recover-a-video**."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
